The '''Fossil Excavator''' is a feature in the {{zone|Dwarven Base Camp}}'s sub area {{Zone|Fossil Research Center}} at {{Coords|19|120|227}} that allows players to use [[Chisels]] and {{Item|Suspicious Scrap}} in order to get rewards. 

== Interface ==
{{/UI}}

== Mechanics ==
=== Chisels ===
{{Main|Chisels}}
A [[Chisels|Chisel]] needs to be selected in order to undergo the Excavating process, all Chisels function the same, but the upgraded Chisels have more Gemstone Slots which provide various bonuses when excavating and also have higher number of {{yellow|Charges}}. Chisel is not consumed or damaged by the Excavating process.
==== Chisel Gemstone Slots ====
{{Main|Chisels#Gemstone Slots}}
Applying [[Gemstones]] to [[Chisels]] will give different perks. All chisels except for the the basic [[Chisel]] have [[Gemstone Slot#Chisel Gemstone Slots|Chisel Gemstone Slots]].
{{:Chisels/Gemstones}}

=== Suspicious Scrap ===
{{Main|Suspicious Scrap}}
The second required item for Excavating is a {{Item|Suspicious Scrap}}, which can be obtained by mining in {{Zone|Glacite Tunnels}}, looting [[Frozen Corpses]], or purchasing for {{Item|Fossil Essence|amount=100}} at the [[Fossil Essence Shop]]. The Suspicious Scrap is consumed upon Excavating.

== Drops ==
=== Fossils ===
Main reward from Excavating are [[Fossils]], most of them can be obtained from excavating, except {{Item|Helix Fossil}} and {{Item|Claw Fossil}}. Fossils can be donated to {{NPCSprite|Dr. Stone}} to get various rewards. Fossils have a {{Green|10%}} chance to appear, all {{Green|6}} of them are equally rare.

