== Tips ==
*To be guaranteed to find fossils using a solver mod (assuming no misclicks), at least 18 charges ({{Item|Reinforced Chisel}}) are required. Certain solvers may require 20 charges ({{Item|Glacite-Plated Chisel}}) for some of the fossils.
*A {{Item|Perfect Chisel}} with {{Item|Perfect Citrine Gemstone|amount=3}} will provide the most treasure per excavation on average.
*It is recommended to do fossil excavation during a [[2x Powder]] event.

